摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A marketplace plugin to quickly integrate your DeepSeek Harness into the GitHub plugin ecosystem.","id":"gh:1333347871","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugin-installer","slug":"Toukaiteio/dsh-plugin-installer","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A marketplace plugin to quickly integrate your DeepSeek Harness into the GitHub plugin ecosystem."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Plugin Installer"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"An in-app marketplace and Profile switcher for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"DSH Plugin Installer adds a **Plugin marketplace** tab to the official Web UI under **Settings → Plu"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"gins**. It discovers repositories from the GitHub `dsh-plugin` and `dsh` topics, verifies that a rep"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ository is a real DSH bundle, installs it at a pinned commit, and helps users open another Web Profi"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"le without leaving the UI."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The project intentionally keeps the interface compact and newcomer-friendly. It uses the official We"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"b UI slot and design-token system, with no separate administration page, emoji, or gradient backgrou"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" slot and design-token system, with no separate administration page, emoji, or gradient backgrounds."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Online discovery from GitHub `dsh-plugin` and `dsh` topics.\n- Excludes the DeepSeek Harness host r"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"epository from plugin-marketplace results.\n- Root `package.json` validation for `dsh.bundle.patch` b"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"efore installation.\n- Verified GitHub Release installs using the published `.tgz` build artifact whe"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"never available; source installs are allowed only when the checked-in JavaScript entry exists.\n- Opt"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"ional Release version selection from the marketplace list; stable releases are preferred by default."},{"id":"p8s6","text":"\n- Release archive SHA-256 verification when GitHub provides a digest.\n- Installation into a selecte"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"d DSH Profile.\n- Installed-state detection from both GitHub dependency specs and package repository "},{"id":"p8s8","text":"metadata.\n- Automatic update checks for GitHub Release versions, plus in-page update and removal act"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"ions.\n- Self-update check for the marketplace plugin itself, with a one-click update of the active p"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"rofile and a restart action to apply it. The old build keeps serving until restart and other profile"},{"id":"p8s11","text":"s are untouched.\n- Interface copy and date formatting that follow the official DSH language preferen"},{"id":"p8s12","text":"ce.\n- Web Profile list, fast Profile opening, and Web Profile creation.\n- Restart guidance and a one"},{"id":"p8s13","text":"-click restart action after installing into the active Profile.\n- Twelve-minute per-query, per-sort,"},{"id":"p8s14","text":" and per-page caching on both the server and client to reduce GitHub API pressure and speed up revis"},{"id":"p8s15","text":"its.\n- Infinite scrolling that fetches the next GitHub search page before reaching the end of the cu"},{"id":"p8s16","text":"rrent list.\n- The marketplace keeps two GitHub-supported repository search orders: updated time and "},{"id":"p8s17","text":"star count.\n- Configure a GitHub API token from the marketplace UI, with an environment-variable fal"},{"id":"p8s18","text":"ount.\n- Configure a GitHub API token from the marketplace UI, with an environment-variable fallback."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Node.js `>=22.19.0`\n- pnpm `>=10`\n- DeepSeek Harness `0.2.0-rc.2` or a compatible release\n- A runn"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ing DSH Web Profile for the in-app UI"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Windows one-click installer"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"On Windows, run the PowerShell installer directly. It downloads the latest stable GitHub Release, ve"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"rifies its SHA-256 digest when available, keeps the archive under `DSH_HOME/plugin-archives/dsh-plug"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"in-installer/` for future dependency resolution, installs it into a DSH Profile, and starts DSH Web "},{"id":"p13s4","text":"for the `web` Profile:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"`-Profile` selects the target Profile. The values `web`, `work`, or any other name you create instal"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"l through the `dsh` command on `PATH`; the reserved `desktop` Profile is installed through the launc"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"her bundled with the DeepSeek Harness Desktop installation, which the script locates from the instal"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"led application (or an explicit `-DshCommand`). After a desktop installation, restart DeepSeek Harne"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"ss Desktop — its Profile composition is read at startup, so the marketplace appears only after the r"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"top — its Profile composition is read at startup, so the marketplace appears only after the restart."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"If GitHub replies with an anonymous rate-limit error, set `GITHUB_TOKEN` and run the script again."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### GitHub API token"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Open **Settings → Plugins → Plugin marketplace → GitHub request settings** and paste a GitHub token "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"when the anonymous API limit is reached. The token is never returned to the browser after saving. It"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"mous API limit is reached. The token is never returned to the browser after saving. It is stored in:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"If `DSH_HOME` is not set, DSH's default home directory is used. Saving an empty value clears the tok"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"en saved by this plugin. For unattended installation, the server-side `GITHUB_TOKEN` environment var"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"iable is also supported and is used when no plugin-saved token is present."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The marketplace treats a GitHub topic as a discovery hint, not as a trust decision. When a user choo"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ses **Install**, the host side:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"1. Reads the repository metadata and the latest GitHub Release.\n2. Fetches the root `package.json`.\n"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"3. Requires a valid `dsh.bundle.patch` declaration.\n4. Prefers a version-matching `<package-name>-<v"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ersion>.tgz` Release asset, verifies its digest when available, and keeps it under `DSH_HOME/plugin-"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"archives/` before installation.\n5. If no suitable Release exists, permits a commit-pinned source ins"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"tall only after confirming the package's declared JavaScript entry exists in that exact commit."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The marketplace installs built Release archives when available, so a source repository's `prepare` s"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"cript is not used in that path. The guarded source fallback remains subject to DSH/pnpm lifecycle-sc"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"sed in that path. The guarded source fallback remains subject to DSH/pnpm lifecycle-script behavior."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"If a repository has neither a usable Release archive nor a verifiable built JavaScript entry, the ma"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"rketplace refuses the installation and explains why. A source fallback that needs a `prepare` build "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"script requires an explicit per-plugin confirmation."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"GitHub topics are not a security review or an endorsement. The installer validates the bundle shape "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"and pins the selected commit, but it cannot audit third-party source code. Review a repository befor"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"e installing it, especially when it requests an install or build script."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The GitHub API token is read on the server only. It can come from the marketplace settings or the se"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"rver-side `GITHUB_TOKEN` environment variable; it is never sent back to the browser. The saved token"},{"id":"p28s3","text":" is written under the current `DSH_HOME` and is protected with the current user's profile permission"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"s. Use a token with the minimum permissions needed for public repository metadata."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
